      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُبَّادَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A garment of felt</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ لِبْد</span>, S, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُبُود</span>,
L, K,) <i>worn on account of rain,</i> (S, L, Msb, K,)
<i>to protect one therefrom:</i> (TA:) <i>a garment of
the kind called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبَآء</span>. (L.)

